MK1 STANDARD LIBRARY

This collection of `.mk1` files provide a basic standard library for programing in [rainbows].

[rainbows]: https://github.com/htogta/rainbows

Simply run `just build` to combine all of the files in this directory into one `std.mk1` file. Then, when you build an assebmly program and run it in [rainbows] using this library, simply do the following:

```
cat std.mk1 your_program.mk1 > out.mk1
lua mk1.lua out.mk1
rainbows out.okb
```
